@baseUrl = https://localhost:7180
@token = PASTE_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE

### Sign in (after database setup and demo seed)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"customer","password":"Learning123!"}

### Customer accounts
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/me/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Partner bill lookup (sign in as cashier first)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/partner/accounts/W-1001/bills
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Submit one full bill payment (use a new GUID only for new work)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"billId":1,"amount":700,"clientReference":"32ad3524-1285-4a0c-9f3b-79e69d267751","mockPaymentToken":"demo-approve"}
